WEBVTT

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.150
There exists a private school where students with the powers of Elements have gathered.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.860
This school is known as Tenbi Academy.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:17.030
But within this school, there are students who choose to use their powers to cause trouble.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.700
In response to this serious problem,

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.580
the school decided to form a group led by students from the Student Council,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.750
which became known as the Magical Security Organization.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.210
Using sacred treasures called Maken,

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.810
they endeavor to thwart those who use their Element to commit crimes.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.470
The people have referred to these students as Maken-ki.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.810
daiji na koto ha muzukashii koto janakute

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.810
Important things are not complicated things

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:52.300
mune ni himeta daisuki na kimochi

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:52.300
They are feelings hidden within your chest

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:09.240
otome no you ni rakuen wo yume mite

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:09.240
Like a maiden, dream of paradise

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:14.840
negau yori mo kanae ni dekakeyou

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:14.840
Instead of just wishing for it, let's go out and make it a reality

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:25.680
baiburu ni mo tekisuto ni sae mo kaitenai koto taiken shiyou

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:25.680
Let's experience things that haven't been written in the bible or in textbooks

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.210
yaritai koto ya naritai mono

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.210
Things you want to do and things you want to become

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:36.900
zenbu jiyuu jizai jibun shidai

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:36.900
You have the freedom to do anything

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:42.790
taisetsu dakara mamoritai wake janakute

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:42.790
It's not that you want to protect them because they're important

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:48.040
jidouteki ni dakishimeteru

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:48.040
You automatically hold them close

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.050
daiji na koto ha muzukashii koto janakute

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.050
Important things are not complicated things

00:01:54.410 --> 00:02:03.270
mune ni himeta daisuki na kimochi

00:01:54.410 --> 00:02:03.270
They are feelings hidden within your chest

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.320
Idio-Take!

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.440
<i>I worked up a good sweat!</i>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.820
You're living under the same roof as a group of girls now,

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.870
so you have to knock!

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.490
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.160
S-Sorry, Haru-nee.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.710
I ran longer than usual, so I'm running kinda la—

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.460
I heard Haruko-senpai scream followed by a loud explosion.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.300
Oh, just as I thought.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.380
Takeru-sama is down for the count!

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.760
Hang in there, Takeru-sama.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.550
Upsy-daisy!

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:46.470
You can't die in such a cliché manner!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.350
I think that I'd be happy to die like this.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.600
Inaho-chan.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.150
You shouldn't spoil him.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:54.610
Okay!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.490
Goodness, every single morning.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:02.490
Don't you ever get tired of going through the same routine every day?

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.870
Good morning, Kodama-senpai!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.290
Right. Good morning.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.500
Good morni—

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.980
Ooyama Takeru.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:20.720
You never seem to tire of <i>this</i>, either.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.470
If you gaze upon me with such lecherous eyes,

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.680
you know what's going to happen to you!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:33.770
Hurry!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.950
And every morning, we barely make it in time.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.950
Takeru-sama!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.240
So could you please try to hold back on using your Element's power a little?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.830
We always have to spend so much time tidying up the mess you make.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.040
Come on! Hurry it up!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.000
You guys again?!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:04.010
If you don't get a move on, Principal Minori-chan's fan will set you ablaze!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.400
Takeru-sama! Fight!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.520
Don't worry about me. Just go on ahead.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.400
Okay! Latecomers confirmed!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.400
Maken Kamudo!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.830
Safe!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.580
Thanks!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.710
Oh well.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.550
Now, hurry and get to cla—

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.050
Takeru!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.550
Usui, what's wrong?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:49.760
There's been an incident!

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.830
Wh-What a perverted occurrence!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.860
It certainly is terrible, but this type of case suits us perfectly, doesn't it?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.940
Th-This is...

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.360
This is horrible.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.160
Inaho-chan, let's take it down.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:07.950
Right.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.660
Move along now. This is not a show.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.750
I wonder who could have done such a thing.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.420
Usui, do you know who the girl in the picture is?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.840
A first-year named Kinoshita Yumika-chan.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.710
She's in the archery club.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:22.670
So knowledgeable.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.050
She's cute.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:24.970
Haru-nee.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.550
I want to ask Kinoshita-san about what happened.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.050
Will you come with me?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.930
Sure. Let's go.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.060
Inaho-chan, report this to the president.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.020
Roger!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.770
I won't allow such perverted behavior to go unpunished!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.610
How did it go, Haru-nee?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:44.570
Well...

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.200
She said she went to the bathroom in the middle of the night...

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.320
when suddenly, a black creature appeared out of nowhere.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.580
She doesn't remember what happened after that.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.210
Has anything changed around Kinoshita-san lately?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.170
Maybe she's attracted a stalker for instance?

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:04.420
She can't think of anything that would be related to what happened.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:09.010
If this wasn't done because of a grudge against Kinoshita-san herself,

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.220
then there's a good chance this type of attack will be committed again.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.060
Hello, Inaho-chan?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.100
Huh?! Another one?!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.080
Two girls at once this time?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.540
They are third-year students, Adachi Sakura-san and Shinomiya Saki-san.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.530
It seems they were attacked in the dressing room,

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.660
after their morning drama club practice.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.580
They have no recollection of who did it.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.330
So these <i>are</i> indiscriminate crimes, after all.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.500
Oh, President. Yuuka-senpai, too.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.090
Everyone, it appears there have been three more victims.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:48.670
Huh?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.510
As the president of the Student Council,

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.010
I request that the Security Council and Magical Security Organization

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.470
convene for an emergency meeting.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:56.850
Understood?

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.020
Y-Yes!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:04.610
Beginning late last night, a series of underwear theft has swept through the school.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.860
Six people have already fallen prey.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.570
With the exception of the fact that the victims were all female,

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.170
we have found nothing tying the attacks together.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:16.580
There is a strong possibility that these crimes were committed solely for pleasure.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.290
According to my profiling,

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.000
the culprit is most likely a male student from this academy,

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.540
who, I believe, possesses an incredibly perverse personality.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:29.130
All of these incidents transpired in the women's restroom or dressing room.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.430
Because of this, we will be limiting entrance to those areas,

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.180
as well as greatly increasing our level of surveillance.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.010
Haruko-san, Inaho-san, and Kodama-san.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.060
Keep watch over the dressing rooms.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:38.560
Okay.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:39.350
Right!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.180
Understood.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.140
Kimi-san and Chacha-san.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.310
Watch over the poolside dressing room.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:43.980
Okay.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:44.940
Roger.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.650
Azuki-san and Uruchi-san.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.650
The women's bathrooms are yours.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:48.730
Got it.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.690
I understand!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.860
Yuuka and I will remain here to supervise.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.410
Um, what about us?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:55.570
What should we do?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.160
Since the places we must protect are private areas for use only by women,

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.080
there is nothing for you men to do.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:05.380
You can just patrol the academy grounds.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.710
Y-Yes...

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.800
At any rate, we cannot allow the number of victims to increase.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.680
Student Council and Magical Security Organization,

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.260
you must work together and use all your strength to apprehend the criminal!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.220
Yes!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.860
Serial underwear thief, huh?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.200
Geez. What in the world are kids thinking these days?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:44.160
Minori, as the principal, shouldn't you do something about this?

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.830
There's no need for me to do anything.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.790
We should just leave it up to the kids to handle their own problems.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.710
Just like how we used to do it, right,

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.340
first generation Maken-ki member, Nihou Aki-sensei?

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.470
That's true.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.270
So we've been left out.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.190
I thought it would be a chance

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.610
to enter the girls' dressing rooms and bathrooms under the pretense of official business.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.770
As if that would happen.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.980
I'm just kidding.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:17.070
But now that the dressing rooms and bathrooms are being closely guarded,

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.330
I doubt the culprit will be able to strike again.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.830
I hope you're right.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.870
Hey! That underwear thief has struck again!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:25.750
What?!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.550
That's the math...

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.760
I can't believe he's targeting teachers, too.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.800
He hit our blind spot.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.220
Jeez, Take-chan. Don't stare so intently.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.020
Haru-nee.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.730
I still don't know what the culprit's motives are,

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:53.030
but I have an idea of who his next victim might be.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.070
Huh?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.610
All of these incidents...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.360
are following a pattern!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.000
A commonality between the culprit's attacks?

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.250
What do you mean, Take-chan?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.330
Haru-nee. No, everyone. Please listen.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.380
From Kinoshita Yumika-chan to Imai-sensei,

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.260
there are seven victims in total.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:22.640
Actually, each time underwear is stolen from the victims...

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:27.390
the cup size of the bra increases by one!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.560
S-So what?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.860
So we know who the next possible targets are.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.780
Wait a moment.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:39.030
According to the reports, the second victim, Adachi-senpai,

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.360
has an F-cup bra.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.580
Shouldn't the second victim have a B-cup?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.710
So that we wouldn't discover the pattern, the culprit

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.330
used a concealment trick.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.420
Concealment trick?

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:57.460
That's right. Adachi-senpai was wearing an F-cup bra,

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.470
but in reality, she only has a B-cup chest.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.840
She had been padding her bras.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.680
In other words, she was trying to enhance her appeal!

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.140
How can you be so sure about that?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Just now, Usui and I took a look at Adachi-senpai.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.330
To calculate her actual size,

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:32.000
we observed her breasts from a range of different angles.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.840
The result was a B-cup.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.670
We, who love boobs...

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.920
...have come to this conclusion from incessant observation.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.180
This is the true "So boys!" Theor—

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.260
That last part was unnecessary.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.510
Okay...

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.350
But if Take-chan's theory is correct,

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.940
and there have already been seven victims...

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:59.320
A, B, C, D, E, F, G...

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:03.950
So the next woman targeted will have an H-cup!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.570
What, H-cup?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.410
No one in this school is <i>that</i> big...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.620
U-Um...

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.250
That is, um...

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:21.420
Here! Like the blue bird of happiness, she was so close!

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.130
I'm an H too, ya know!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.590
Another one!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:29.510
Yuuka-san, can you access the school hospital records

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:33.480
and see if there are any other students with an H-cup?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:40.860
According to the data, only Haruko-san and Chacha-san have an H-cup.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.610
How could there possibly be any more?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.530
That's right.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:47.820
By the way, Principal Rokujou Minori's are even bigger.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:53.290
She has an I-cup.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.830
Someone with so little sex appeal has breasts that big?!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.920
Above her is...

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:00.050
the school doctor, Nijou Aki-sensei.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.130
Amazingly, she boasts a K-cup.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.510
K... for King of Cups?

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:13.100
At any rate, if Ooyama's deduction is indeed correct,

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:17.600
the culprit will attack either Haruko-san or Chacha-san next.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.150
This is a good chance.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:22.110
We can use Haruko and Chacha to bait the perpetrator.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.860
No! Definitely not!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.400
Without even taking Chacha-senpai into account,

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.910
there's absolutely no way we can put Haruko-senpai in danger!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.740
What about me?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.370
I will do it!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.000
Haruko-senpai?!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:41.000
In order to prevent anyone else falling victim,

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:44.210
I... I will be the bait.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.800
Are you really okay with that, Haru-nee?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:52.010
Actually, I'm a little scared, but Take-chan, no...

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.610
I believe that the members of Maken-ki will definitely protect me.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:59.400
Yes, of course we will, Haru-nee.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:01.610
Yes.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.030
I understand.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:05.820
Well then!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:12.450
Haruko-san and Chacha-san will stay in the hard-to-enter pool changing room.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.500
I wouldn't let ya be the bait alone!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:20.130
While remaining hidden, we will tightly monitor all possible entrances.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.630
There is a good chance the culprit has noticed our movements.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.630
Everyone, please tread carefully.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.470
As expected, we've been left outside on standby.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.770
This is all we can do.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.810
Even though I promised to protect Haru-nee...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.320
Th-That is!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.570
Circle Shunjukai's latest issue, Miko-chan's adultery book!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.280
Why is it here?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.740
Excellent. It's all mine!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.740
Haru-nee.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.410
Haru-nee.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.420
Usui, have we received our scheduled contact yet?

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.710
They called me just now.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.960
I'll let you know if something happens.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.630
Yeah. I'll leave it to you.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.180
Why do we need to dress up like this?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.350
We're doin' it to lure in the culprit.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.060
Like the colors? These are brand new!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.560
I wish I could be as carefree as you, Chacha.

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.650
But be careful.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.860
We don't know how he's going to attack us.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.360
Don't worry.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.780
There's only one entrance.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:33.410
Whoa!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.280
Wh-What the heck is that?!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.580
Chacha, stay back!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.260
Huh?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.510
S-So cute.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.090
Huh?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.180
Wh-What is that?!

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.940
So big! So manly!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.410
Himegami-senpai, the president ordered me to bring them something.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.830
Right, understood.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.050
It's a good thing that the two of you are together.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:38.810
You can take off each other's bra.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.020
Usui sure is taking a while.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:54.650
What's that sound of self-inflicted pleasure?!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.740
So good! So good!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.700
Usui! Why are you here?!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:03.830
No way?!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.790
Now, take each other's underwear off.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.210
Th-This will be cup number eight!

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:15.340
All that's left is the principal...

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.840
and Aki-sensei!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.020
Haru-nee! Chacha-senpai!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.190
Wh-What the hell is going on?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.860
D-Don't get in my way!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.910
You're behind this?!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.910
You!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.960
Why are you doing this?

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:47.920
Answer me!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.420
I'll answer your question with another question.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:56.800
Do you require a reason to take perverted pictures of women and steal their bras?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:57.550
What?!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.890
I am asking you if there needs to be a reason for a man to follow his instincts.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.060
You're a man, too, right?

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:07.640
Have you never thought of doing the same as I have?

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.270
Th-That is...

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.070
Heh. You're just scum that is tied down by self-restraint and common sense.

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:17.450
Just stay there and watch on helplessly.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.910
My way of life as a man!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:36.090
Are you an idiot?!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.300
What do you mean, "your life as man"?! This country...

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.760
is a lawful one!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:49.140
There are fundamental rules that everyone has to follow!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.730
Finding gaps in those rules and exploiting them for your own pleasure...

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:55.870
are not the actions of a healthy perverted kid.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.360
In other words...

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.700
that's the path of a true pervert!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.160
Your perverted ways are twisted.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.160
I will fix that with my fist!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.000
What you're saying is crazy, too!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.120
Take this!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.170
Drive Duo!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.770
Did he go... too far?

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.190
No, that was well deserved.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.400
President?

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.860
It looks like this case has been resolved.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.410
Haru-nee.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:47.700
Haru-nee.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.250
Haru-nee.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.120
Get a hold of yourself, Haru-nee!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.540
Take-chan...

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.630
The culprit?

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:01.760
Don't worry.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.930
We caught him.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.720
I see. That's good.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.470
I'm sorry. I was late saving you.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:15.060
No. It was a little scary, but I believed...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:20.940
that everyone... that you would come, Take-chan.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.110
Haru-nee.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.490
Take-chan?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.130
Wh-Why am I like this?!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.590
Don't worry! The culprit didn't see you.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.800
That's not the problem here!

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.550
And I was so happy you came to save me...

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.190
I thought you even looked a little cool!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.610
Y-You...

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.360
Idio-Take!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.370
I... can't eat anymore...

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.370
I have received the report about the underwear thief.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.290
Good work!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.540
Excuse me.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.300
Goodness.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.470
Troubles keep arising one after another.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.600
But that's how Tenbi is every day.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:45.650
Even this will become a fond memory in the end.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:52.580
Just like when we were in Maken-ki ourselves.

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:16.760
shou ni to kurai machigatte mo ii

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:16.760
It's okay to be a little wrong, so don't worry

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.210
tobikomunda yo

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.210
Just jump right in

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:25.890
zenryoku de butsukachaeba hora doa ha hiraku

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:25.890
If you strike it with all your might, the door will open

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:29.070
kimi to watashi

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:29.070
You and I

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:30.370
futari naraba

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:30.370
If we're together

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:32.070
donna yume mo

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:32.070
no matter what the dream is,

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:33.120
tsukameru kara

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:33.120
we will seize it

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.710
nani mo mayowazu ni yukou

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.710
Let's move forward without any hesitation

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:40.300
hikari ni te wo nobase

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:40.300
Outstretch your hands toward the light

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.670
omoikiri

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.670
With all your
strength

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:43.740
onoga kono michi tsugi susumu mukou

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:43.740
Abandon the path that leads to the past and keep moving forward

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:47.020
yuruganai ketsui womune ni

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:47.020
With unfaltering feelings in your heart

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:48.690
koi wo kogareteta

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:48.690
Yearning for love

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:57.440
arata na mirai no ichi no ichi peeji wo kimi to tomoni mitsuke ni yukou

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:57.440
Let's find the first page of our new future together

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:00.040
Let's go! Let's go!

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:07.180
narihibiku munasawagi no ashita he

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:07.180
To the tomorrow that makes your heart flutter

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:27.960
Who are you?

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.260
Where am I?

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:31.050
I am Amaya Haruko.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:31.930
What's wrong, Haru-nee?

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:35.510
Could it be that episode two is an amnesia story?!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:37.010
That's exactly right!

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.930
Next time: "I love Takeru-kun!"
